The word data in this directory (data/) is adapted from:

- The New General Service List (NGSL) 1.2
- The New Academic Word List (NAWL) 1.2

by Charles Browne, Brent Culligan and Joseph Phillips, https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.

Changes: the 500 most frequent NGSL words and 81 technical NAWL terms were removed, the two
lists were merged into one ranked list, and Hebrew translations, parts of speech and example
sentences were added.

The adapted data is licensed under the same Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This license applies only to the data. The app code is under the MIT License (../LICENSE).
